{"title":"Banker","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Banker is a townsperson who trades — a named <a href=\"#/monster/human\">Human</a> seen at level 1–35.</p>\n      <h2>Wearing</h2><p>The <a href=\"#/guide/outfits\">Banker</a> outfit</p><div class=\"gear-line\"><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>torso</i> Fine Shirt Charcoal</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>legs</i> Fine Trousers</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>feet</i> Buckled Shoes</span></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find Banker</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>Binxonia Bank</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 3×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-10\">Layout</button></li><li>Inside <b>Plymouth Wharf - Bank</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 3×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-1\">Layout</button></li><li>Inside <b>Wispmeyer Bank</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 1×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"1\">Layout</button></li><li>Inside <b>Underleaf building</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 1×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-1000010028\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"banker\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Other named Humans</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/binxonia-guard\">Binxonia Guard</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/stablemaster\">Stablemaster</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/mira\">Mira</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/lumberjack-trainer\">Lumberjack Trainer</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/exchange-clerk\">Exchange Clerk</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/osric-blane\">Osric Blane</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/james-hookman\">James Hookman</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/hollis-tamber\">Hollis Tamber</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/wes-brooke\">Wes Brooke</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/priest\">Priest</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/tailor\">Tailor</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/abrey-fenn\">Abrey Fenn</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/ada-fen\">Ada Fen